WEBVTT


00:08:17.296 --> 00:08:21.858
For as long as I can recall,
I've been running...


00:08:22.034 --> 00:08:25.026
"Melon"


00:08:25.204 --> 00:08:28.196
"Condemned. Do not enter."


00:08:53.366 --> 00:08:55.926
Hey sis, looks good.


00:08:56.636 --> 00:08:57.694
Father.


00:09:04.243 --> 00:09:08.111
This enough? A little more, sis?


00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:10.773
That's enough.


00:09:11.083 --> 00:09:13.381
Kika.


00:09:14.820 --> 00:09:16.720
Look who's back.


00:09:18.925 --> 00:09:20.825
"Yubari City Police"


00:09:22.862 --> 00:09:25.194
"Rikka & Yasushi Miyata"


00:09:25.298 --> 00:09:26.822
They're brother and sister?


00:09:27.133 --> 00:09:29.397
Just your average murderers.


00:09:29.702 --> 00:09:34.105
Kika-pie.
Where've you been squirreled away?


00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:37.676
We've been looking for you. Right, sis?


00:09:38.144 --> 00:09:40.408
They killed more than 20 people.


00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:44.209
Think you can get away from us?


00:09:45.151 --> 00:09:46.140
And the bodies?


00:09:46.252 --> 00:09:48.482
They ate them!


00:09:48.621 --> 00:09:50.748
No way!


00:09:53.893 --> 00:09:56.361
You really are a freak!


00:10:03.569 --> 00:10:06.834
You always cause mother so much trouble.


00:10:11.210 --> 00:10:15.647
You have no idea how much
pain it was giving birth to you.


00:10:29.528 --> 00:10:34.158
Everything is mine for the taking!


00:10:59.425 --> 00:11:01.518
Kika! Run...


00:11:03.863 --> 00:11:06.388
Kika-pudding.


00:11:06.866 --> 00:11:10.233
Let's have some fun!


00:11:23.349 --> 00:11:26.876
Kika, run! Get out!


00:11:34.860 --> 00:11:36.259
What's this?


00:11:38.764 --> 00:11:39.753
Ash?


00:12:35.054 --> 00:12:35.918
There!


00:12:42.595 --> 00:12:43.425
Freeze!


00:13:14.727 --> 00:13:16.524
Kika-pumpkin.


00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.763
It's been a while since
you've played with your uncle.


00:13:32.978 --> 00:13:35.003
Still think you can escape?


00:13:35.714 --> 00:13:39.343
You're my slave for life.


00:14:12.952 --> 00:14:15.113
This is mine too.


00:15:13.512 --> 00:15:15.605
Sis, you're awesome!


00:16:48.474 --> 00:16:53.207
On May 15th, a strange ash
suddenly enveloped Hokkaido.


00:16:53.312 --> 00:16:56.543
From there it spread across
the Tohoku region.


00:16:59.184 --> 00:17:04.554
This is Aoba shopping street in the
Northern Province. Things are out of control.


00:17:04.656 --> 00:17:07.591
Get out of here now!


00:17:07.693 --> 00:17:10.856
The situation is...


00:17:22.441 --> 00:17:24.875
For those without gasmasks...


00:17:24.977 --> 00:17:28.037
inhaling the ash caused them
to become infected.


00:17:28.147 --> 00:17:30.911
They fell comatose immediately.


00:17:31.650 --> 00:17:33.311
After an hour...


00:17:33.419 --> 00:17:37.253
antler shaped tumors
sprang from their foreheads.


00:17:37.556 --> 00:17:41.583
They began attacking and eating people.


00:17:42.127 --> 00:17:45.722
An estimated six-million were stricken.


00:17:46.065 --> 00:17:49.000
Thirty-six hours later...


00:17:49.101 --> 00:17:52.366
it drifted into the Sea of Japan
and dissipated.


00:17:54.273 --> 00:17:55.797
What remained in Japan were...


00:17:55.908 --> 00:17:58.638
six-million infected human beings.


00:18:08.020 --> 00:18:13.048
Security unit 3 reporting.
We found something strange.


00:18:13.892 --> 00:18:19.387
To contain the problem, a wall was built
from the Pacific to the Japan Sea.


00:18:19.498 --> 00:18:26.301
It ran along the borders of Tokyo, Chiba,
Yamanashi, Saitama, Ibaraki and Niigata.


00:18:26.405 --> 00:18:28.930
Japan became divided.


00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:32.702
With people evacuating Tohoku...


00:18:32.945 --> 00:18:36.779
Tokyo exploded.
The city became overcrowded.


00:18:36.882 --> 00:18:40.181
Life became hell for the residents.


00:18:48.227 --> 00:18:52.755
It's unlike anything ever seen.


00:18:52.998 --> 00:18:56.627
A bill to consider the infected
as dead didn't pass.


00:18:56.735 --> 00:18:59.002
"Protect the infected. Support human rights!
" The infected still maintained human rights.


00:18:59.003 --> 00:18:59.369
"Protect the infected.
Support human rights!"


00:18:59.370 --> 00:19:02.672
"Protect the infected. Support human rights!
" Families of the infected formed human rights groups.


00:19:02.673 --> 00:19:02.772
"Protect the infected.
Support human rights!"


00:19:02.773 --> 00:19:05.038
"Protect the infected. Support human rights!
" They fought to protect the infected.


00:19:05.177 --> 00:19:08.340
I don't consider the infected
to be deceased.


00:19:08.614 --> 00:19:10.946
They are human.


00:19:11.683 --> 00:19:15.915
We must extend them the same rights
we do to all.


00:19:16.088 --> 00:19:18.079
Protect the afflicted.


00:19:18.257 --> 00:19:20.418
Protect our beloved families.


00:19:20.692 --> 00:19:23.092
Fathers, mothers...


00:19:23.228 --> 00:19:25.355
Our children...


00:19:25.464 --> 00:19:28.024
they need our help.


00:19:40.479 --> 00:19:41.878
It's impossible.


00:19:41.980 --> 00:19:45.472
She has no heart, yet she lives!


00:19:57.829 --> 00:19:59.023
"Public Announcement"


00:20:05.504 --> 00:20:10.100
"One household, Three-Family System."
We're strangers united together.


00:20:10.709 --> 00:20:13.803
We have a new law.


00:20:13.912 --> 00:20:17.313
Happiness first for our Japan.


00:20:23.088 --> 00:20:25.852
"The infected are human!"
"Japanese Government"


00:20:31.396 --> 00:20:34.923
"The world of the infected."


00:20:36.501 --> 00:20:38.093
Those who inhale the ash...


00:20:38.203 --> 00:20:41.195
show dysfunction
in their metabolic system.


00:20:41.506 --> 00:20:43.872
"Tokyo provisional shelter for the infected"


00:20:44.009 --> 00:20:45.909
"Hollywood"


00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:47.273
"The Grudge"


00:20:50.115 --> 00:20:52.106
"District 10"


00:20:52.951 --> 00:20:55.818
For now, no treatment exists.


00:21:05.530 --> 00:21:10.900
They show a predilection
to attack and devour people.


00:21:11.937 --> 00:21:12.926
Hiroko.


00:21:25.183 --> 00:21:28.482
Stay away from them... please!


00:21:35.227 --> 00:21:36.819
Even if attacked...


00:21:41.333 --> 00:21:44.427
no case of infection through cuts
has been reported.


00:21:44.536 --> 00:21:46.834
Lop off an arm...


00:21:47.906 --> 00:21:49.999
Shoot them with a gun...


00:21:50.142 --> 00:21:52.076
they won't die.


00:21:52.177 --> 00:21:54.441
Cut off their head - no dice!


00:21:54.913 --> 00:21:59.407
Their vital spot is here!
The horn!


00:21:59.851 --> 00:22:01.944
It contains an unknown substance.


00:22:04.556 --> 00:22:06.547
If ground into powder...


00:22:06.958 --> 00:22:11.156
it acts like an illicit drug!


00:22:11.296 --> 00:22:16.233
Just say no!


00:22:16.468 --> 00:22:19.198
"Horn harvesting prohibited by law"


00:22:19.338 --> 00:22:20.896
Hey, hey! You there!


00:22:23.175 --> 00:22:25.905
That's illegal.


00:22:26.011 --> 00:22:28.275
There's gonna be trouble!


00:22:35.253 --> 00:22:37.187
Oh boy.


00:22:43.161 --> 00:22:45.095
"Horn material is unstable and volatile."


00:22:49.267 --> 00:22:51.633
"Hatoda administration is trying to kill us!"


00:22:51.903 --> 00:22:53.996
"Japan is for the living!"


00:23:02.080 --> 00:23:04.071
We must shelter them.


00:23:04.216 --> 00:23:06.081
"The infected are dead.
They are monsters."


00:23:06.218 --> 00:23:09.016
"Human rights for the infected."


00:23:09.187 --> 00:23:12.953
"One household three families homicide."
"What happened to the three-family system?!"


00:23:13.091 --> 00:23:17.494
Three-family system, right?
They were just strangers to each other.


00:23:20.332 --> 00:23:21.959
We're all strangers, after all.


00:23:26.037 --> 00:23:33.603
This land is our land!


00:23:33.779 --> 00:23:36.976
"Sushi Typhoon"


00:23:37.115 --> 00:23:40.050
"Indica Rice. Akita Komachi"


00:23:41.019 --> 00:23:42.111
Here you go.


00:23:46.992 --> 00:23:48.391
Two is enough!


00:23:51.129 --> 00:23:54.064
It's whale!
Loaded with mercury!


00:23:55.734 --> 00:23:58.362
Hey, idiot? Two is enough!


00:23:58.470 --> 00:24:00.165
This is sushi!


00:24:03.475 --> 00:24:06.342
Get your tasty roaches!


00:24:06.411 --> 00:24:08.106
"Saut ed Cockroach"


00:24:08.213 --> 00:24:09.305
"Top seller"


00:24:29.534 --> 00:24:31.263
Hurry it up!


00:24:31.636 --> 00:24:34.434
We can get arrested.


00:24:34.673 --> 00:24:38.234
Clean this mess now!
If word gets out...


00:24:58.797 --> 00:25:01.698
That was a year ago.


00:25:26.758 --> 00:25:27.588
You there!


00:25:30.729 --> 00:25:32.822
This is a restricted area.


00:25:33.331 --> 00:25:36.232
Hands up and take off your hoods.


00:25:45.810 --> 00:25:47.607
Put down the bag.


00:25:48.780 --> 00:25:50.213
Look...


00:25:50.348 --> 00:25:51.372
Down!


00:26:01.092 --> 00:26:01.717
Shit!


00:26:12.771 --> 00:26:14.363
Get off...


00:26:15.540 --> 00:26:16.472
Get off...


00:26:21.780 --> 00:26:23.407
Get off!


00:26:25.884 --> 00:26:28.580
You shooting at me? Idiot!


00:31:24.649 --> 00:31:26.913
Holy...


00:31:36.060 --> 00:31:36.856
Crap!


00:31:38.363 --> 00:31:39.830
Don't move!


00:31:39.998 --> 00:31:41.090
Run!


00:31:43.668 --> 00:31:44.828
This way.


00:31:46.271 --> 00:31:47.169
"Kamikaze Orphanage"


00:32:04.689 --> 00:32:05.815
I'm Taku.


00:32:05.924 --> 00:32:09.951
He's an orphan from up north.


00:32:10.595 --> 00:32:13.928
He never told me his name.
I call him No-name.


00:32:14.666 --> 00:32:16.463
What's your deal?


00:32:20.538 --> 00:32:24.668
Wonderful... Two No-names...


00:32:25.243 --> 00:32:26.471
Kika.


00:32:27.578 --> 00:32:30.911
Kika? Kika it is.


00:32:34.686 --> 00:32:38.087
What were those things?
Zombies?


00:32:38.890 --> 00:32:42.087
Don't you know?
They're the infected.


00:32:42.794 --> 00:32:44.762
You an expat?


00:32:52.937 --> 00:32:54.632
Whatever...


00:33:36.347 --> 00:33:43.776
Although some feel they are soulless,
we feel otherwise.


00:33:43.955 --> 00:33:45.980
"The dead are our enemy"


00:34:09.147 --> 00:34:10.739
"Indica Rice"


00:34:10.882 --> 00:34:13.749
Rice. Rice. Rice. Rice is precious!


00:34:18.890 --> 00:34:22.223
Happiness first for our Japan.


00:34:27.031 --> 00:34:28.862
"Ide Group"


00:35:00.398 --> 00:35:01.729
Put the bag there.


00:35:18.850 --> 00:35:22.342
It was hell getting this.
They're cracking down.


00:35:34.265 --> 00:35:37.792
Hard times grow on trees, it seems.


00:36:04.095 --> 00:36:05.995
"Kamikaze Orphanage"


00:36:14.138 --> 00:36:21.237
"Hayama - Chiba - Nakamura"


00:36:25.983 --> 00:36:27.280
"Kamikaze"


00:36:33.991 --> 00:36:36.459
After the north and south divided...


00:36:37.028 --> 00:36:40.657
my father began to help troubled children.


00:36:41.265 --> 00:36:43.358
He started an orphanage.


00:36:43.668 --> 00:36:45.499
He said, "I am Kamikaze!"


00:36:46.103 --> 00:36:50.733
He got eaten by an infected kid.


00:36:50.841 --> 00:36:52.741
Utterly lame Kamikaze.


00:36:56.113 --> 00:37:00.243
After he died, the kids scattered.


00:37:00.985 --> 00:37:02.646
He's all that's left.


00:37:03.487 --> 00:37:07.389
His parents were eaten and the shock...


00:37:07.491 --> 00:37:11.120
left him speechless. He says nothing.


00:37:12.930 --> 00:37:16.229
Seems he has a sister up north.


00:37:17.802 --> 00:37:20.862
I want to help.


00:37:22.106 --> 00:37:24.540
But it takes money.


00:37:30.314 --> 00:37:33.183
"Prime Minister Hatoda" As long as
they walk on two legs, they're human!


00:37:33.184 --> 00:37:33.282
"Prime Minister Hatoda"


00:37:33.283 --> 00:37:35.184
"Prime Minister Hatoda" No matter
their state, they're not dead.


00:37:35.185 --> 00:37:35.286
"Prime Minister Hatoda"


00:37:35.287 --> 00:37:39.389
"Prime Minister Hatoda" I will never
tolerate just getting rid of them.


00:37:39.390 --> 00:37:39.557
"Prime Minister Hatoda"


00:37:39.558 --> 00:37:43.493
"Justice Minister Osawa"
But, the country is divided.


00:37:44.528 --> 00:37:49.299
"Justice Minister Osawa" Japan's power is fading.
Public order is breaking down.


00:37:49.300 --> 00:37:49.433
"Justice Minister Osawa"


00:37:49.434 --> 00:37:52.891
Unemployment and crime are rising.


00:37:53.004 --> 00:37:56.701
If this continues, other countries
will take advantage of us.


00:37:56.807 --> 00:38:02.803
Guaranteeing those "things" human rights
will destroy Japan.


00:38:02.913 --> 00:38:06.280
Eradicating the infected population...


00:38:06.584 --> 00:38:09.712
and taking back the overrun land is priority!


00:38:10.254 --> 00:38:15.988
The bill you've submitted.
It's legalization of murder!


00:38:16.127 --> 00:38:18.254
It is not!


00:38:19.397 --> 00:38:22.195
It's a guarantee of the right to life
for the non-infected.


00:38:22.466 --> 00:38:26.960
Even if it were,
it will not be approved.


00:38:31.642 --> 00:38:34.008
"Chiba"


00:38:48.392 --> 00:38:51.293
Amazing - doesn't even hurt.


00:38:53.364 --> 00:38:58.131
Frickin' good pudding, sis!


00:38:59.036 --> 00:39:01.436
Caramel is the shit.


00:39:02.973 --> 00:39:04.873
You're so considerate.


00:39:05.042 --> 00:39:08.409
Where'd you get the money?


00:39:08.546 --> 00:39:12.175
Caramel sauce! Heavenly!


00:39:17.121 --> 00:39:19.180
It's Kika's birthday.


00:39:21.926 --> 00:39:23.120
I can't afford cake!


00:39:23.260 --> 00:39:27.390
Pudding for birthday? Dumb ass!


00:39:31.135 --> 00:39:34.263
What are you gaping at?


00:39:34.905 --> 00:39:40.138
Kika-peach.
I'm the one who treats you right.


00:39:40.244 --> 00:39:43.304
Say 'ahh'.


00:39:44.548 --> 00:39:49.485
Happy - friggin' - fuckin' - birthday!


00:41:03.327 --> 00:41:04.521
What is it?


00:41:04.628 --> 00:41:06.095
What's wrong?


00:41:29.653 --> 00:41:32.417
Where are you going?


00:42:11.529 --> 00:42:13.121
Alive!


00:42:13.831 --> 00:42:15.731
She's alive!


00:42:20.571 --> 00:42:22.436
Everything in this world...


00:42:23.140 --> 00:42:25.074
is mine!


00:42:25.609 --> 00:42:26.837
Alive!


00:42:27.845 --> 00:42:29.813
The bitch is alive!


00:42:56.774 --> 00:43:01.768
"Progress Report
Subject 001 - Kika Miyata"


00:43:13.424 --> 00:43:16.723
Mr. Osawa,
what do you think you're doing?


00:43:18.429 --> 00:43:20.624
Osawa, answer me!


00:43:22.333 --> 00:43:25.666
It's an experimental android...


00:43:25.769 --> 00:43:28.237
that will reduce the number of infected.


00:43:28.372 --> 00:43:32.604
Reduce?
You're ignoring their rights!


00:43:32.743 --> 00:43:35.735
Have you no respect for human rights?


00:43:36.580 --> 00:43:39.174
I can't authorize this.


00:43:39.316 --> 00:43:41.307
Do not appropriate the country!


00:43:48.325 --> 00:43:49.587
Excuse me, sir.


00:43:54.865 --> 00:43:56.457
How is the experiment going?


00:43:56.567 --> 00:43:58.159
Excellent, sir.


00:43:58.402 --> 00:44:01.269
It proves effective against the infected.


00:44:03.641 --> 00:44:05.666
What's the prime minister's schedule?


00:44:05.843 --> 00:44:09.404
There's the speech in front of the wall.


00:44:11.181 --> 00:44:15.208
Now is the chance.
Put the plan into action.


00:44:15.486 --> 00:44:16.475
Yes, sir!


00:44:19.490 --> 00:44:20.821
"Progress report"


00:44:20.958 --> 00:44:22.482
"Go Go Yubari Law"


00:44:32.870 --> 00:44:36.966
Boss Andou...
How about a little more today?


00:45:06.236 --> 00:45:09.728
What is most important now is...


00:45:10.407 --> 00:45:13.342
how do we live...


00:45:13.544 --> 00:45:17.571
side by side with the infected...


00:45:17.681 --> 00:45:19.546
behind this wall.


00:45:20.017 --> 00:45:24.647
They are human beings
afflicted by a rare disease.


00:45:25.522 --> 00:45:30.926
To declare them dead
without proper medical treatment...


00:45:31.261 --> 00:45:33.491
Is it justice?


00:45:40.938 --> 00:45:43.304
We have but one choice.


00:45:43.941 --> 00:45:46.842
As they are human...


00:45:47.878 --> 00:45:50.938
we must treat them humanely...


00:45:51.281 --> 00:45:53.374
and coexist together.


00:45:55.953 --> 00:45:59.445
"Girls Bar - Gape the Buns"


00:46:18.008 --> 00:46:22.001
They are human. I pledge...


00:46:23.680 --> 00:46:25.341
to protect them.


00:46:25.916 --> 00:46:28.680
Let's live together.


00:47:18.769 --> 00:47:20.760
Let go!


00:47:23.674 --> 00:47:25.665
Shoot them!


00:47:25.809 --> 00:47:28.676
I can't. They're human.


00:48:05.482 --> 00:48:08.974
These things aren't human!


00:48:09.653 --> 00:48:12.144
They're zombies!


00:49:47.818 --> 00:49:50.651
"Announcement by the government of Japan"


00:49:50.754 --> 00:49:52.688
Hello, death-row inmates.


00:49:53.623 --> 00:49:59.255
I'm Gogo, the newly-constituted
'Go Go Yubari law.'


00:49:59.863 --> 00:50:02.593
The former Prime Minister
was eaten by zombies.


00:50:02.699 --> 00:50:06.157
When new Prime Minister
Osawa took over...


00:50:06.269 --> 00:50:07.793
he enacted me.


00:50:08.005 --> 00:50:12.533
My official name is 'Urgent Anti-Crime...


00:50:12.642 --> 00:50:14.701
Go Go Yubari law.'


00:50:14.811 --> 00:50:19.544
This law is here to give you inmates hope.


00:50:19.816 --> 00:50:21.647
Why Yubari you ask?


00:50:21.752 --> 00:50:27.122
Here is footage from a patrol car in Yubari.


00:50:27.657 --> 00:50:31.252
This woman appears to be
the source of the zombie outbreak.


00:50:31.561 --> 00:50:33.961
The government wants to catch her...


00:50:34.064 --> 00:50:36.828
or destroy her to solve the crisis.


00:50:36.967 --> 00:50:41.097
They tried many ways but...
there are just too many zombies.


00:50:44.274 --> 00:50:45.707
This is why...


00:50:46.009 --> 00:50:48.807
I want you inmates to go to Yubari...


00:50:48.945 --> 00:50:50.310
and find her.


00:50:50.714 --> 00:50:55.344
Apologies for not introducing myself.
I'm Osawa, your new Prime Minister.


00:50:56.219 --> 00:50:59.711
You are Japan's last hope.


00:51:01.224 --> 00:51:03.283
Those buttons by your hand.


00:51:08.131 --> 00:51:12.727
Press "O" and you'll be found innocent
and go after the zombie queen.


00:51:12.936 --> 00:51:14.699
And win a cash prize.


00:51:16.640 --> 00:51:20.974
Press "X" and
you'll be tried before regular laws.


00:51:21.611 --> 00:51:23.738
It's not compulsory.


00:51:25.082 --> 00:51:27.175
It's up to you!


00:52:11.228 --> 00:52:13.287
Damn, more blood... Careful.


00:52:13.864 --> 00:52:16.196
Kind of slippery.


00:52:23.206 --> 00:52:26.039
Food, weapons,
whatever your needs...


00:52:26.376 --> 00:52:28.435
you provide yourself.


00:52:29.913 --> 00:52:30.971
You lowlifes...


00:52:31.915 --> 00:52:34.213
will be given a GPS gun.


00:52:34.351 --> 00:52:38.879
It connects to
a satellite missile guidance system.


00:52:39.456 --> 00:52:42.186
When you find the zombie queen,
fire it.


00:52:43.226 --> 00:52:44.955
We'll send backup.


00:52:46.029 --> 00:52:47.792
Are you sure we can kill her?


00:52:50.400 --> 00:52:52.265
If you even get that far.


00:53:24.935 --> 00:53:27.096
Zombie World bids you welcome!


00:54:09.913 --> 00:54:13.007
This sucks.
Like watching rice grow.


00:54:13.483 --> 00:54:15.474
Cool if I smoke, boss?


00:54:39.809 --> 00:54:41.140
Hey you!


00:54:41.244 --> 00:54:45.078
If you see a convenience store,
make a pit stop.


00:55:11.908 --> 00:55:13.034
Hey.


00:55:16.179 --> 00:55:17.976
Hey... you.


00:55:44.607 --> 00:55:46.097
Up!


00:55:46.242 --> 00:55:47.470
Up!


00:55:48.178 --> 00:55:49.577
Up!


00:55:49.913 --> 00:55:51.346
And away!


00:56:03.960 --> 00:56:05.427
Lift off!


00:56:26.916 --> 00:56:28.440
Bombs away!


00:56:49.472 --> 00:56:50.632
Stop!


00:56:51.174 --> 00:56:52.607
Let go!


00:57:38.087 --> 00:57:40.078
Run!


00:57:50.700 --> 00:57:52.497
What is it?


00:57:56.372 --> 00:58:00.274
It's the bitch.


00:58:44.220 --> 00:58:45.687
Let's go, now!


00:59:03.406 --> 00:59:04.498
Get in!


00:59:29.766 --> 00:59:32.496
Incredible...


00:59:33.136 --> 00:59:35.195
Simply incredible.


00:59:35.371 --> 00:59:37.362
Find her soon.


00:59:49.619 --> 00:59:52.247
What's your deal?


00:59:53.590 --> 00:59:55.490
I was looking for my family.


00:59:55.825 --> 00:59:57.315
Was?


01:00:03.499 --> 01:00:05.364
Are you a cop?


01:00:05.802 --> 01:00:06.860
Was.


01:00:08.204 --> 01:00:10.263
Find them?


01:00:10.840 --> 01:00:12.364
Found them eaten.


01:00:14.344 --> 01:00:18.178
I see. That's tough.


01:00:20.249 --> 01:00:24.151
Now, I just survive.


01:00:26.489 --> 01:00:30.220
Ever met other survivors?


01:00:33.296 --> 01:00:34.786
Seen what I seen.


01:00:37.333 --> 01:00:38.630
It's his sister.


01:00:39.569 --> 01:00:42.902
Her name is Maya.
Have you seen her?


01:00:47.777 --> 01:00:50.905
Can't say. But...


01:00:51.280 --> 01:00:55.512
If she's alive
there's only one place she'd be.


01:00:55.785 --> 01:00:56.843
Where?


01:00:57.320 --> 01:00:58.651
The zombie bar.


01:01:00.523 --> 01:01:02.787
That's my name for it.


01:01:09.666 --> 01:01:12.396
Come one... Come all...


01:01:12.568 --> 01:01:15.230
Yummy! Cheap!


01:01:37.560 --> 01:01:39.619
Scrumptious!


01:01:47.303 --> 01:01:48.395
See that?


01:01:49.505 --> 01:01:54.533
Some of them are getting smart.
They catch humans and eat them.


01:01:57.980 --> 01:02:04.442
Let me out of here
you pus-brain bags of shit!


01:02:53.336 --> 01:02:54.530
That asshole.


01:03:03.513 --> 01:03:04.502
Maya?


01:03:21.397 --> 01:03:24.525
Will you help rescue her?


01:03:25.968 --> 01:03:27.902
I've got nothing to lose.


01:03:29.505 --> 01:03:31.803
I'm ready for death.


01:03:32.441 --> 01:03:35.877
I'll be a decoy.
You guys do what you have to.


01:03:36.012 --> 01:03:37.411
Wait.


01:03:37.647 --> 01:03:38.978
I'll go with you.


01:03:39.982 --> 01:03:42.507
Well, what do we call you?


01:03:43.352 --> 01:03:44.944
Call me...


01:03:46.489 --> 01:03:47.615
Kaito.


01:08:20.863 --> 01:08:22.125
Get out!


01:09:49.385 --> 01:09:50.409
Kika.


01:10:43.439 --> 01:10:45.339
Feed me!


01:10:51.080 --> 01:10:52.479
Put 'em up!


01:13:59.835 --> 01:14:00.859
Enough!


01:15:15.143 --> 01:15:16.235
No!


01:15:16.879 --> 01:15:18.642
No way!


01:15:37.766 --> 01:15:40.530
Ow!


01:18:41.516 --> 01:18:42.710
Get in!


01:19:11.913 --> 01:19:14.040
Kika-petunia!


01:19:15.684 --> 01:19:18.710
Rock with your uncle!


01:19:26.862 --> 01:19:28.295
Brace yourselves!


01:19:58.960 --> 01:20:01.053
Bloody hell, can't see!


01:20:39.801 --> 01:20:42.929
We are all alive, hah! Zombie car, attack!


01:20:45.440 --> 01:20:47.704
I'll eat anything!


01:21:18.974 --> 01:21:19.998
My hand!


01:21:36.191 --> 01:21:37.920
My hands are getting numb.


01:21:52.107 --> 01:21:54.371
Got ya!


01:22:18.533 --> 01:22:21.127
Hey! No! Don't!


01:22:33.181 --> 01:22:35.172
Taku, let go.


01:22:37.819 --> 01:22:39.218
No! No!


01:22:50.865 --> 01:22:51.889
It hurts!


01:22:55.704 --> 01:22:56.966
It fucking hurts!


01:22:57.906 --> 01:22:59.635
My turn!


01:25:10.271 --> 01:25:13.365
Stupid! Stupid!


01:25:20.648 --> 01:25:22.047
Kika!


01:25:22.217 --> 01:25:22.774
Kaito!


01:26:15.837 --> 01:26:17.771
I dig it! I dig it!


01:26:38.927 --> 01:26:40.121
Kika. Taku.


01:26:40.428 --> 01:26:42.293
Kika, get off!


01:26:42.430 --> 01:26:43.294
But!


01:26:43.431 --> 01:26:47.162
I'd be a third wheel.
Go get revenge!


01:26:47.602 --> 01:26:49.570
Take care of No-name.


01:26:51.439 --> 01:26:52.565
I will.


01:26:52.740 --> 01:26:54.401
Here goes.


01:26:56.744 --> 01:26:59.941
"Kamikaze"


01:27:02.283 --> 01:27:04.513
This is Kamikaze spirit!


01:27:19.634 --> 01:27:21.363
Banzai!


01:28:17.058 --> 01:28:19.891
Still haven't found her?


01:28:23.498 --> 01:28:24.692
"Artificial Heart Unit"


01:28:33.975 --> 01:28:36.967
"Protection for non-infected
by artificial heart unit"


01:28:58.933 --> 01:29:00.400
What're you gonna do?


01:29:00.902 --> 01:29:02.529
I'll kill that woman.


01:29:04.205 --> 01:29:05.638
Woman?


01:29:05.740 --> 01:29:09.301
The cause of this mad Japan.


01:29:12.947 --> 01:29:14.938
And my mother.


01:29:17.819 --> 01:29:22.222
I have to stop her.


01:29:26.394 --> 01:29:27.986
I'm sick of running.


01:29:31.132 --> 01:29:35.626
Let me help.
I've nowhere else to go.


01:29:37.004 --> 01:29:42.203
I'll have... revenge.


01:29:56.224 --> 01:30:01.059
They are human. Not zombie.


01:30:01.329 --> 01:30:03.661
We cannot kill them.


01:30:04.999 --> 01:30:08.662
They are the new human race.


01:30:09.003 --> 01:30:11.267
Coexisting with them is...


01:30:11.372 --> 01:30:12.498
Stuff it!


01:31:00.221 --> 01:31:01.210
"Yu Kitano"


01:31:01.389 --> 01:31:03.050
"Ichiro Koizumi"


01:31:18.072 --> 01:31:19.403
"Haruka Nishimura"


01:32:19.433 --> 01:32:21.628
Close... very close.


01:33:27.435 --> 01:33:28.663
It's time.


01:33:51.325 --> 01:33:55.887
"Melon"


01:34:20.855 --> 01:34:22.254
Here?


01:34:40.241 --> 01:34:41.037
You ok?


01:34:55.222 --> 01:34:57.213
Welcome home.


01:34:59.026 --> 01:35:01.859
Rikka! My heart!


01:35:02.563 --> 01:35:04.292
Give it back!


01:35:04.999 --> 01:35:06.227
So stupid.


01:35:08.002 --> 01:35:10.436
Tickle, tickle, tickle.


01:35:10.571 --> 01:35:12.562
Tickle, tickle, tickle.


01:35:16.310 --> 01:35:18.710
Tickle, tickle, tickle.


01:35:21.382 --> 01:35:23.282
You and your heart exist...


01:35:23.384 --> 01:35:25.511
because of me.


01:35:25.653 --> 01:35:28.247
I've nothing to do with you.


01:35:28.355 --> 01:35:30.846
The one who raised me was...


01:35:30.958 --> 01:35:32.721
dad!


01:35:32.860 --> 01:35:34.760
Ungrateful punk.


01:35:38.132 --> 01:35:39.861
Why don't you keel over?


01:35:49.844 --> 01:35:52.335
Not yet? When?


01:36:06.594 --> 01:36:08.858
The signal!


01:36:11.665 --> 01:36:13.633
This is it!


01:36:48.803 --> 01:36:50.395
A direct hit!


01:37:20.034 --> 01:37:22.559
Nobody messes with me.


01:37:36.417 --> 01:37:38.476
What in the...?


01:37:41.555 --> 01:37:44.786
Die! Die! Die!


01:37:45.392 --> 01:37:47.121
Die already!


01:38:23.063 --> 01:38:24.087
Hold it!


01:38:29.737 --> 01:38:30.726
Kika!


01:38:58.799 --> 01:39:00.790
What the hell is it?


01:39:01.101 --> 01:39:02.625
Excuse me, sir!


01:39:03.037 --> 01:39:05.130
It's an all-out attack by the zombies!


01:39:05.839 --> 01:39:08.034
Get ready for battle!


01:39:14.114 --> 01:39:15.012
"Glory of Japan!"


01:39:15.149 --> 01:39:16.138
"Reunite Japan!"


01:39:21.355 --> 01:39:22.652
Sister.


01:39:45.779 --> 01:39:47.269
Annoying bitch!


01:39:58.692 --> 01:39:59.716
Hit the road!


01:40:22.182 --> 01:40:24.776
You! Hold it!


01:40:25.552 --> 01:40:26.610
Who me?


01:40:26.887 --> 01:40:30.084
Get me up there!


01:40:30.924 --> 01:40:32.289
Okie dokie!


01:41:07.895 --> 01:41:10.591
Kika-precious.


01:41:12.766 --> 01:41:17.601
The genie is out of the bottle!


01:41:18.672 --> 01:41:21.232
You are Takahashi, right?


01:41:21.708 --> 01:41:22.231
Uh-huh.


01:41:22.876 --> 01:41:25.936
That makes you Kodaira, right?


01:41:27.648 --> 01:41:30.708
Nasty! Here we go!


01:41:41.195 --> 01:41:43.993
What... What's happening?


01:41:57.010 --> 01:42:00.275
Takahashi! Kodaira!


01:42:26.406 --> 01:42:28.533
They're here! Thousands!


01:42:33.680 --> 01:42:34.669
Not yet.


01:42:40.521 --> 01:42:42.682
They're nearing the wall, captain.


01:42:43.957 --> 01:42:44.889
Stand firm!


01:44:44.611 --> 01:44:47.444
There, there. Good boys.


01:44:49.783 --> 01:44:52.980
We're family... all of us.


01:44:59.459 --> 01:45:03.987
Everything is glorious!


01:45:19.980 --> 01:45:22.448
Sis!


01:45:23.116 --> 01:45:24.879
We're being overrun!


01:45:26.219 --> 01:45:28.016
Ah... No!


01:45:30.324 --> 01:45:31.689
No good!


01:45:32.526 --> 01:45:33.515
Ah...


01:45:34.861 --> 01:45:36.021
Kaput!


01:45:39.566 --> 01:45:40.590
Who's there?


01:46:49.569 --> 01:46:51.127
A zombie!


01:46:51.304 --> 01:46:52.293
Open fire!


01:47:38.251 --> 01:47:41.414
Kika-poo! Ready to pack it in?


01:47:43.590 --> 01:47:46.650
All's well that ends well!


01:47:47.194 --> 01:47:48.752
Take this!


01:47:51.665 --> 01:47:53.690
Take that!


01:47:56.269 --> 01:48:00.171
Takahashi? What's wrong?


01:48:02.576 --> 01:48:03.702
Kodaira?


01:48:06.179 --> 01:48:10.309
Kodaira... Takahashi?


01:48:10.584 --> 01:48:12.518
Is that all you got?


01:48:13.019 --> 01:48:15.647
Wanna call it quits?


01:48:16.189 --> 01:48:17.713
I'll erase your email addresses.


01:48:18.058 --> 01:48:20.788
Maybe we shouldn't see
each other anymore.


01:48:21.328 --> 01:48:24.388
While it lasted, it was really...


01:48:25.265 --> 01:48:26.493
swell.


01:48:29.870 --> 01:48:33.397
You are one persistent ass wipe!


01:48:41.515 --> 01:48:44.177
Kika-princess! Catch you later!


01:49:02.335 --> 01:49:03.393
Rikka!


01:49:13.547 --> 01:49:16.778
Give back everything you took!


01:49:21.288 --> 01:49:22.585
Brainless fool.


01:49:23.423 --> 01:49:25.186
Try, if you can.


01:49:28.862 --> 01:49:31.695
Friggin' insane whore-slut.


01:49:32.265 --> 01:49:33.789
What was that?!


01:49:54.387 --> 01:49:57.823
Watch your language.
Don't talk like that to your mother.


01:50:04.531 --> 01:50:07.261
You rely on force...


01:50:07.400 --> 01:50:09.265
and never helped dad.


01:50:43.536 --> 01:50:46.505
Give it back!


01:50:47.340 --> 01:50:50.207
Give my heart back!


01:50:50.677 --> 01:50:54.238
Give my father back!


01:50:54.614 --> 01:50:57.879
Give my life back!


01:50:58.818 --> 01:51:03.312
Give my pudding back!


01:51:04.224 --> 01:51:09.924
My... My... My... My...


01:51:11.765 --> 01:51:13.665
Give it all back!


01:51:16.936 --> 01:51:18.995
Hold it, Kika.


01:51:20.273 --> 01:51:22.298
Mom was wrong.


01:51:23.309 --> 01:51:25.504
Forgive her.


01:51:26.212 --> 01:51:29.443
She was only manipulative.


01:51:32.185 --> 01:51:34.949
You can forgive your mom.


01:51:35.622 --> 01:51:36.611
Can't you?


01:52:33.813 --> 01:52:35.303
It's over.


01:52:56.836 --> 01:52:58.360
Kika!


01:53:00.039 --> 01:53:02.906
Live!

